vine 1.2.0
prefix: grimoire
title: Grimoire plan for the full vision
---
[grimoire] Grimoire v1 (started)
The full vision: a frozen core specification satisfied by its grammar, projection language, schemas, and layers, with one worked description that exercises all of it.
-> example/reference
-> viz/design
> Scaffolded from dependsOn out of the core skeleton; places not yet defined carry Design-with-the-user nodes.
> Mechanical nodes are annotated dispatch(mechanical) and carry step-level guidance a weaker agent can execute; design and review stay with the user and Claude.
> Fauxlden Retriever is a synthetic consumption exercise, not a source of product priorities.
---
[example/reference] Reference worked description (notstarted)
One synthetic whole-system description exercised end to end across every layer and validated by the reference tooling. Its purpose is to keep the language from overfitting before a real consumer exists.
-> consumers/golden-retriever
-> layers/cost
-> layers/hyperparameters
-> layers/info-flow
-> layers/mode
-> layers/placement
-> layers/provenance
-> tools/validator
> Candidate system: the V-JEPA self-distillation setup.
---
[tools/validator] Reference validator and canonical serializer (notstarted) @dispatch(mechanical)
Implements the constraints: addresses, scoping, locality, cuts, checks, canonical serialization. Conforms to the specification; never the definition.
-> grammar/review
