[projlang/design] Design with the user: projection language semantics (notstarted)
Fragment semantics, recursion and stratification, fold behavior at join points, evaluation of symbolic axes.
-> core/freeze
> Inherits the transferred question: whether three fragments suffice, and which layer first demands a fourth.
