[schemas/axes] Design with the user: axes schema (notstarted)
Symbolic axes as addressed declarations at definition sites, subject to locality like any declaration. Open question: which element at a definition site carries an axis declaration (the anchoring convention) — not mechanical, needs to be settled with the user rather than drafted and escalated by an agent.
-> namespaces/minting
-> schemas/meta
@guidance text/markdown ./spec/grimoire.md
